<title>SOUTH AFRICA: IBCA reaffirms AECI domestic ratings.</title>
<headline>IBCA reaffirms AECI domestic ratings.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>European credit rating agency IBCA said on Wednesday it had reaffirmed AECI Ltd's domestic A1 short-term and A long-term ratings.</p>
</text>
